      "name": "Highlands Coffee",
      "client": {
        "link_type": "Document"
      },
      "description": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A product campaign introducing the refreshed Highlands Coffee ground coffee packaging — where Vietnam's highland landscapes are brought to life through bold visual design. ",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        }
      ],
      "detail_description": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Film brought to life through a cinematic product film, the campaign opens with a single bag standing against a vast highland landscape bathed in the warm glow of sunset. Mountains layer into the distance. Light shifts. The product is not just placed in nature — it becomes part of it. ",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Some stories are best told through the senses — through the rich aroma of freshly ground coffee, the warmth of a familiar cup, and the quiet pride of knowing where it all began.",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        }
      ],
